{"seq":2,"slug":"automated-sorting-distribution","title":"自动分拣与配送","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/smart-warehousing-distribution/automated-sorting-distribution","wordCount":1351,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"自动分拣与配送\">自动分拣与配送</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>从仓库拣选完成到包裹送达消费者手中，分拣与配送构成了物流履约的&quot;最后一公里&quot;生命线。自动分拣系统以每小时数万件的处理能力替代了人工分拨，而末端配送则在无人化、即时化方向持续突破，两者共同决定了消费者感知到的物流时效与服务体验。</p>\n<h3 id=\"自动分拣系统类型\">自动分拣系统类型</h3><p>自动分拣系统根据分拣执行机构的不同分为多种类型，适用于不同的包裹特性与产能需求：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;自动分拣系统&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;交叉带分拣机&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;滑块分拣机&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;摆臂/翻板分拣机&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;AGV 分拣&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;处理能力: 2-4万件/小时&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;适用: 小件快递/电商&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;处理能力: 1-2万件/小时&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;适用: 中件/箱式货物&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;处理能力: 5000-1万件/小时&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;适用: 大件/重货&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[&quot;灵活性: 最高&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[&quot;适用: 多变场景&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"自动分拣系统\"] --&gt; B[\"交叉带分拣机\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"滑块分拣机\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"摆臂/翻板分拣机\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"AGV 分拣\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"处理能力: 2-4万件/小时\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"适用: 小件快递/电商\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"处理能力: 1-2万件/小时\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"适用: 中件/箱式货物\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"处理能力: 5000-1万件/小时\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"适用: 大件/重货\"]\n    E --&gt; E1[\"灵活性: 最高\"]\n    E --&gt; E2[\"适用: 多变场景\"]</pre><p><strong>交叉带分拣机</strong>是快递行业应用最广泛的设备：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>原理：每个小车（Cell）上有独立皮带，沿环形轨道运行，经过目标格口时皮带侧向启动将包裹推入</li>\n<li>核心参数：载重（通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span></span></span></span></span> 30kg）、小车数量（200-400个）、环线速度（1.5-2.5m/s）</li>\n<li>分拣准确率：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>99.9</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;99.9\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99.9%</span></span></span></span></span>（结合视觉识别）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>分拣系统产能计算</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3600</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = \\frac{3600 \\times v}{L_{cell}} \\times \\eta_{load}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1574em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3600</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 为环线速度（m/s），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{cell}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为小车间距（m），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_{load}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为供件率（已装载小车占比）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"末端配送模式\">末端配送模式</h3><p>末端配送是物流成本最高（占比约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span>）且体验敏感度最强的环节：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>单件成本</th>\n<th>时效</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>快递员上门</td>\n<td>1.5-3元</td>\n<td>次日达</td>\n<td>标准快递</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>智能快递柜</td>\n<td>0.3-0.5元</td>\n<td>自取</td>\n<td>白天无人签收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无人配送车</td>\n<td>0.8-1.2元</td>\n<td>30min-2h</td>\n<td>社区/园区即时配送</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无人机</td>\n<td>2-5元</td>\n<td>15-30min</td>\n<td>紧急/偏远地区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>驿站代收</td>\n<td>0.4-0.6元</td>\n<td>自取</td>\n<td>成本敏感型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"同城即时配送算法\">同城即时配送算法</h3><p>即时配送（如外卖、生鲜）的调度核心是在极短时间窗内完成订单-骑手匹配与路径规划：</p>\n<p><strong>双边匹配模型</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>O</mi></mrow></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max \\sum_{i \\in O} \\sum_{j \\in R} u_{ij} \\cdot x_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4804em;vertical-align:-1.4304em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4304em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个订单最多分配给一名骑手：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{j} x_{ij} \\leq 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>每名骑手容量约束：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i} x_{ij} \\leq C_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>时间窗约束：骑手到达时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span></span></span></span></span> 承诺送达时间</li>\n</ul>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为订单 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 分配给骑手 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的效用（考虑距离、时间、顺路度），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为骑手同时携带的最大订单数。</p>\n<p>美团配送2025年数据：日均配送订单超7000万单，平均送达时间28分钟，调度系统每3秒生成一次全局最优匹配方案。</p>\n<h3 id=\"包裹追踪技术\">包裹追踪技术</h3><p>全链路追踪是物流可视化的基础，覆盖从揽收到签收的每个节点：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;揽收扫描&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;集包建包&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;干线运输&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;转运分拨&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;末端配送&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;签收确认&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"揽收扫描\"] --&gt; B[\"集包建包\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"干线运输\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"转运分拨\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"末端配送\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"签收确认\"]</pre><p><strong>技术栈</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>条码/二维码</strong>：成本最低，但需逐件扫描</li>\n<li><strong>RFID</strong>：批量识别，无需视线对准，单标签成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 元</li>\n<li><strong>GPS/北斗</strong>：运输车辆实时定位，精度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span></span></span></span></span>3-5m</li>\n<li><strong>蓝牙信标（iBeacon）</strong>：仓内定位，精度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span></span></span></span></span>1-3m</li>\n<li><strong>UWB 超宽带</strong>：厘米级定位，用于高精度 AGV 导航</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"分拣中心设计要点\">分拣中心设计要点</h3><p>大型分拣中心（日处理100万件+）的规划需考虑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>峰值设计</strong>：按日均处理量的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span></span></span></span></span>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0</span></span></span></span></span> 倍设计产能，应对大促峰值</li>\n<li><strong>冗余通道</strong>：关键设备设置旁通路径，避免单点故障导致全线停摆</li>\n<li><strong>人机混合</strong>：异形件（如书画、轮胎）仍需人工分拣通道</li>\n<li><strong>能耗管理</strong>：大型交叉带分拣机功率达 200-500kW，需考虑错峰运行</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>视觉AI分拣</strong>：基于深度学习的包裹识别（面单OCR+体积测量+破损检测）实现无人化供件</li>\n<li><strong>柔性分拣</strong>：AGV 矩阵式分拣（如立镖机器人）取代固定设备，布局可按需调整</li>\n<li><strong>即时零售配送</strong>：从&quot;次日达&quot;到&quot;小时达&quot;再到&quot;分钟达&quot;，前置仓+众包骑手模式持续下沉</li>\n<li><strong>碳中和配送</strong>：电动配送车/电动三轮替代燃油车，骑手路径优化减少总行驶距离</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某快递分拨中心需要在2小时内完成8万件包裹的分拣。已知交叉带分拣机环线速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0</span></span></span></span></span> m/s，小车间距 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span> m，供件率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">75\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">75%</span></span></span></span></span>。请计算需要部署几条分拣线（考虑 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span> 冗余）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>分析无人配送车在社区场景的落地挑战：从技术（路径规划/障碍物识别）、运营（取件流程/异常处理）、成本（车辆摊销/远程监控）三个维度评估其替代传统快递员的可行性。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个即时配送调度的简化算法：3名骑手、6个待配送订单，已知各骑手当前位置、各订单商户位置和客户位置、承诺送达时间。请手动求解一个可行的分配方案。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>自动分拣与末端配送是物流订单从&quot;信息态&quot;转化为&quot;实物态&quot;的最终执行环节。交叉带分拣机以高速度和高准确率成为快递行业的标准配置，而末端配送正在从单一的人工上门向多元化模式（快递柜/无人车/无人机/驿站）演进。即时配送的调度算法体现了运筹优化在实时场景中的工程实现，全链路追踪技术则让物流透明化成为可能。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自动分拣与配送","id":"自动分拣与配送"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"自动分拣系统类型","id":"自动分拣系统类型"},{"level":3,"text":"末端配送模式","id":"末端配送模式"},{"level":3,"text":"同城即时配送算法","id":"同城即时配送算法"},{"level":3,"text":"包裹追踪技术","id":"包裹追踪技术"},{"level":3,"text":"分拣中心设计要点","id":"分拣中心设计要点"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"智能仓储系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/smart-warehousing-distribution/intelligent-warehouse-systems"},"next":{"title":"冷链与特种物流","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/smart-warehousing-distribution/cold-chain-special-logistics"}}